 * Data.test.tsx — UI tests for the DataPage (Data & system status).
 *
 * Validates:
 *   - H1 "Data & system status" renders
 *   - L1/L2 live-collector rows render with snapshot counts
 *   - Regime is humanized (not raw 'BULLISH')
