=== health-report.ts (the only real code) ===
/**
 * Health report for the web shell (deploy probe). House pattern, mirroring
 * services/api/src/edge.ts `buildDalHealth`: `deployed_sha` from env
 * (DEPLOYED_SHA || VERCEL_GIT_COMMIT_SHA || …) plus a FAIL-CLOSED dependency
 * report — a missing/unknown sha or a missing/invalid gateway origin flips
 * `ok:false` and the route answers 503. Pure + dep-free so it is unit-testable
 * without booting Next.
 *
 * The web shell holds NO PII and NO secrets (SPEC-03 static shell); its only
 * runtime dependency is the BD-resident gateway origin, which is NEXT_PUBLIC
 * (shipped to every browser) — so echoing it here discloses nothing new.
